    "detailed_description": "The Void is nothing - and it is everywhere. Everything disappears.<br />\r\nOnly Essence can stop it. And Void somehow knows it - and sends Demons to deplete the Essence Source.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLead your fleet from island to island and repell Demon forces.<br />\r\nPut your units in right places, use their abilities and create Towers to protect the Essence Source and destroy Demons' buildings. Plan and exequte before Demons take over the island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResolve encounters and upgrade your fleet to survive ever growing strength of the Void.<br />\r\nBe strong - you are the only Essence Defender in this sector!",
